{"id":"NCT02941458","title":"Thoracic Tumours Register","official":"Thoracic Tumours Register","summary":"Observational, multicenter study in patients with lung cancer and other thoracic tumors.\n\nThe GECP, in its commitment to improve the treatment and prognosis of patients with lung cancer and other thoracic tumors, has marked the individualization of treatment according to the expression of markers predictive of response to chemotherapeutic agents and molecular inhibitors of cell proliferation as one of its primary objectives. This could significantly improve the prognosis of patients with lung cancer, and will lead to a radical change in routine clinical practice. The aim of the register is to explore all data available of all patients treated because of thoracic tumours.","conditions":["Thoracic Tumors"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients with thoracic disease, treated with an active treatment or not treated (only palliative care)\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients with other type of tumours","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":10000,"start":"2016-07-21","pcd":"2030-12-30","upd":"2026-04-23","sponsor":"Spanish Lung Cancer Group","areas":["oncology"],"central":["Eva Pereira · +34934302006 · epereira@gecp.org"],"sites":[{"f":"Complejo Hospitalario Universitario de Ferrol","city":"Ferrol","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":43.4845,"lon":-8.2329,"c":"Javier Afonso, MD"},{"f":"Complejo Hospitalario Universitario de Albacete","city":"Albacete","pr":"","zip":"05200","s":"R","lat":38.9942,"lon":-1.8564,"c":"Esther Noguerón, MD"},{"f":"H. Virgen de los Lirios","city":"Alcoy","pr":"","zip":"03804","s":"R","lat":38.7054,"lon":-0.4743,"c":"Milagros Franco, MD"},{"f":"Hospital General de Alicante","city":"Alicante","pr":"","zip":"03010","s":"R","lat":38.3452,"lon":-0.4815,"c":"Bartomeu Massutí, MD-phD"},{"f":"Hospital de Elche","city":"Elche","pr":"","zip":"03202","s":"R","lat